(d97cece8560018b1bb9a0cc057ebf302dc28ddbdPolarsADSImprovements2Po11arr/PolarsADSImprovements
$4E0107FD-F943-42FF-BAE2-66C3A0F4A0D2Polar's ADS Improvements*sReplaces vanilla's twitchy first-person weapons with CoD / Battlefield ADS sensitivity and variable per-weapon zoom2Polar:∞
        Aim-down-sights tuning for hand weapons, CoD / Battlefield style.

        - FOV-based sensitivity: replaces vanilla's flat 0.6x ironsight look speed with monitor distance matching (coefficient 1.33, the CoD / Battlefield default), so aim feels the same at any zoom.
        - Per-weapon zoom: set the magnification of every hand weapon, modded guns included. Vanilla presets: pistols 1.5x, launchers 1.75x, MR-8P 3x, others 2x.
        - Smooth zoom: eased zoom in and out (0.15 s).

        Keys: none of its own. Aim with your usual key; hold or toggle aim is the vanilla option in Options > Game.
        Settings: coefficient 0 to 2, ADS multiplier, zoom time, default zoom 1 to 6x, one row per weapon.

        Client-side only, works on any server. Only your view and mouse speed change.
        Compatible with Polar's PVP Lean, Scrollable FOV and Zoom (their zoom stacks on top).
        Known issues: modded guns join the list once a world with them is loaded.

        Docs and bug reports:
        https://github.com/Po11arr/PolarsADSImprovements
    
