$22C5F3D1-AE85-4FB1-96FB-E53E9ABBF035Better Store*WA Store screen that trades with your whole ship: buy what fits, sell all, round amounts2Viktor:£
        Replaces the screen of the Store block with one that is quicker to trade on.

        - Pick your docked ship instead of a cargo container. The plugin puts what you buy into the containers with room for it, and takes what you sell from the containers that hold it.
        - Round amounts with one click: 100 kg, 1 t, 10 t, 100 t, half, or all that fits. Type "2.5t" if you want something else.
