(baf963c0e86232aa457e08093a793797f63b93dcClientPlugin2lolifamily/ChineseAnywhere
$09540800-AB40-476F-B4BC-A708CF797D96Chinese Anywhere*9Display and type Chinese and Japanese in any UI language.2
lolifamily:‘Display and type Chinese and Japanese in any UI language, without translating anything.

Missing characters come from the game's own Chinese and Japanese fonts: all common Simplified Chinese and kana, about 3/4 of common kanji and 2/3 of common Traditional Chinese; the rest show as boxes.

Also fixes the game's IME support:
- the candidate window shows at the caret
- Enter confirms the word, not also the dialog
- Enter, Tab, undo and redo work in multi-line boxes like the Programmable Block editor
- undo takes back a whole word from the IME
- Up and Down keep the caret's column after typing
- mods receive the typed text
- IME work now runs on the game thread: no crashes while composing, no garbled text at low FPS
- text box focus changes no longer wait for the render thread: no hitch, no freeze with -render_sync
- no system-wide keyboard hook, which delayed every keystroke in other programs

In every UI language, undo and redo leave the caret where the text changed.RWindows,Proton
