(082f1a50a751dc754821a27e1a902007218144c8ClientPlugin2lolifamily/HdrRender:#
AssetFolderClientPlugin/Assets/
$65ECACE0-FF8F-4166-962E-495E7A93CF78
HDR Render*yFull HDR pipeline: fp16 scRGB swapchain, BT.2390 tonemapping, R16 lighting buffer, separate UI brightness, emissive boost2
lolifamily:†Replaces SE's SDR tonemapping pipeline with a true HDR path.
Swapchain is upgraded to flip model R16G16B16A16_Float with scRGB color space.
Lighting, bloom and post-process buffers are upgraded to R16G16B16A16 for full-precision HDR.
BT.2390 tonemapping keeps the original shadows and midtones at a configurable paper white and extends highlights up to the display peak.
Emissive billboards and GPU particles (flames, muzzle flashes, exhaust) can be boosted; diffuse content is untouched.
UI and in-world overlays (block highlight, gizmos, crosshair) have their own brightness setting.
Screenshots are captured as OpenEXR (HDR) and tonemapped PNG (SDR) in parallel.
Optional G-Sync/FreeSync tearing support and low-latency mode (1-frame GPU queue).
Auto-disables itself if it crashes during init, with a flag in the config to re-enable.
Requires Windows HDR enabled and a supported display; can be force-enabled on SDR displays.
Œ∫_
