$A683CE5F-104A-496E-BB29-B4C795D70B2BOreScout*WTurns what your ore detector sees into GPS markers you can keep, sort and come back to.2scotlandsyard:¥Server-friendly ore scouting: turns what your ore detector can see into GPS markers you can keep, sort and come back to.

Every scan starts at a working ore detector block and reaches only as far as that detector's own range, so it shows nothing the vanilla ore detector couldn't already reveal. Its markers carry a hidden tag, so OreScout only ever changes markers it made itself; your own GPS points are never touched.

Quick start:
1. Drag an ore detector onto a toolbar and pick Scout Ore or Scout Deposits.
2. The detector must be intact, switched on and powered. Its range slider sets the scan radius.
3. Type /scout in chat for the Marker Library.

Guide: https://github.com/scotlandsyard/SpaceEngineersPlugins/tree/main/Projects/OreScout
Report bugs: https://github.com/scotlandsyard/SpaceEngineersPlugins/issues
