Po11arr/PolarsADSLeanPolar's ADS Lean*NRainbow Six style leaning on foot: hold Q or E to lean round corners and shoot2Polar:∆
        Rainbow Six style leaning for on-foot PvP. Hold Q or E.

        - A real side-step: the server and other players see you lean out. Hitbox and gun move with you, shots go where you aim.
