        - Stops at walls. Let go and you step back to where you started.
        - Walk sideways while holding the lean to keep it. Letting go always straightens you up.
        - Works standing, crouching, through jumps and on moving ships.

        Works offline, hosted and on dedicated servers. Client-side only: it just presses strafe for you. Off in jetpack, on ladders, in seats and on remote controls, turrets and cameras.

        Keys: Q and E (vanilla roll, unused on foot). Rebindable, with Ctrl, Alt or Shift.
        Settings: hold or toggle, lean distance 0.2 to 0.8 m, camera tilt 0 to 20 degrees.

        Works with Polar's ADS Improvements and head tracking.
        Known issues: third person gets the side-step but no tilt.

        Docs and bug reports:
