$4672C1EB-783C-49D5-942F-C20F386A8665Polar's Hold Crouch*gHold the Crouch key to crouch, release it to stand up. Hybrid and vanilla toggle modes in the settings.2Polar:∂Crouch while the Crouch key is held, stand up when it is released.
A quick tap toggles instead (Hybrid mode, the default).

Usage:
- Hold Crouch (C by default) to crouch, release it to stand up
- Uses the game's Crouch binding, keyboard or controller
- Pressing Crouch while crouched still stands you up
- No headroom, falling or jetpack on when you release: you stand up as soon as you can

Settings (Settings button in the Pulsar plugin list, also in game):
- Crouch mode: Hybrid (default), Hold or Toggle (vanilla)
- Hybrid: a tap under 0.25 s toggles, a longer press works like Hold
- Applies immediately, saved in Storage/PolarsHoldCrouch.cfg

No effect in cockpits, seats, on ladders, in spectator, in menus or while chat is open.

Client-side only, no server install. No Harmony patches.
Tested in single player and on a dedicated server.

Known issues: none reported.

Bugs and suggestions:
