(8a8bc21a7837b5cde85a424b4ae09c09d1be8bc1ClientPlugin2lolifamily/RenderQueueFix
$ED17552B-4A6B-474C-99B9-13FB67F5CF19Render Queue Fix*aInstall ONLY if your game crashes with IndexOutOfRangeException inside MyConcurrentTwoLevelQueue.2
lolifamily:πFixes one specific renderer crash by raising a hardcoded queue ceiling.

===== INSTALL ONLY IF =====
your game crashes to desktop AND the SpaceEngineers log contains BOTH of:
  1) the exception System.IndexOutOfRangeException
  2) a stack frame mentioning MyConcurrentTwoLevelQueue.Enqueue or MyUpdateFrame.Enqueue

Common triggers:
  - very large or densely built worlds
  - long sessions in busy scenes (many lights, particles, decals, LCDs)
  - mass-spawn / stress tests / heavy combat with lots of effects

===== WHAT IT DOES =====
VRage.Render hardcodes a per-frame render-message ceiling of 1024 x 1024 ~= 1.05M. Exceeding it throws inside the renderer and kills the game. This plugin rewrites the ceiling to 4096 x 1024 ~= 4.19M at load time via Mono.Cecil. Memory cost: ~24 KB. No API change, no gameplay change.
    
