$17843B40-D5CB-4DBB-9C7A-1F246F842E87Sacrificial Stockpile Manager*TInventory sorting, block restocking and autocraft quotas, set up in an in-game menu.2scotlandsyard:†Inventory management and auto-restocking, set up in an in-game menu instead of block names or Custom Data.

- Shows the inventory of every ship and station you own.
- Sorts items into the storage blocks you choose.
- Keeps blocks between a minimum and a maximum of an item: lockers, reactors, generators, turrets, refineries.
