AssetFolderPrism.Render/Shaders/
StarCpt/Prism.SSGI'Screen Space Global Illumination (SSGI)*<Adds single-bounce screen space diffuse global illumination.2StarCpt:›Adds single-bounce screen space diffuse global illumination.

This is a gpu-heavy plugin, and you will experience a significant drop in fps when it is enabled. Various parameters can be changed in the plugin settings, including quality presets and GI intensity.

