$AC284074-A676-4930-B47A-F30450988608Undo*nCtrl-Z / Ctrl-Y undo and redo for building, painting, grid paste and delete, terminal changes and text fields.2Viktor:’
        Undo and redo with Ctrl-Z / Ctrl-Y
        
        - Placing and removing blocks, grid splits included
        - Removed blocks come back with their settings, inventory and toolbar slots
        - Rotors, hinges, pistons and connectors come back with what they held
        - Painting and skins
        - Pasting and deleting grids
