        - Friends multiplayer as the host. Joined players who run Undo get it too.
        - Joining a friend's game, if the host runs Undo
        - On a dedicated server running the Undo companion, a Magnetar plugin from MagnetarHub. The server keeps the history and checks every step.

        Where it is off, it records nothing and all keys stay as in the game.

        Relative dampeners and toggle all reactors move to Ctrl-Shift-Z and Ctrl-Shift-Y. With nothing to undo, Ctrl-Z is still relative dampeners. All keys can be changed in the plugin settings.

        Video: Ship editing
        https://youtu.be/fS_KpBiItiU

        Video: Terminal fields
        https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xcvybKVaNjA

        Please see the full documentation on GitHub:
        https://github.com/viktor-ferenczi/se-undo

        For support please join the Pulsar Discord: https://discord.gg/z8ZczP2YZY
        Please consider supporting my work on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/semods
    
