(e31f251c951251fed606934e3cac5cdf92285164Projects/Wilson/Source/Shared/PluginSwitcher.csShared/Toolbox.csShared/ListSearch.csShared/Personality.csShared/PluginStorage.cs2#scotlandsyard/SpaceEngineersPlugins
$974C2D6B-52D9-4B3A-A387-F2D41C9FEACDWilson*iDirects the chat personalities of BaR Maid, Fat Albert, Stockpile Manager, Script to Plugin and OreScout.2scotlandsyard:ÍThe neighbour over the fence. Wilson directs the chat personalities of our other plugins (BaR Maid, Fat Albert, Sacrificial Stockpile Manager, OreScout and the rest), and has a few words of his own.

With Wilson loaded, the plugins tell him when something happens and he decides who speaks, now and then with a short exchange between several characters. Chat lines only show on your own screen, so it's fine on any server.

Quick start:
1. Load Wilson with any of our other plugins and he directs their chat. About ten seconds after the world loads, he calls the roll.
2. Type /wilson in chat to rename characters or set their chat on the Crew page.
3. /wilson off|quiet|normal|chatty sets how much he directs.

Guide: https://github.com/scotlandsyard/SpaceEngineersPlugins/tree/main/Projects/Wilson
Report bugs: https://github.com/scotlandsyard/SpaceEngineersPlugins/issues
